      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JIVE MASTER (7) draws on the back row but has produced some good efforts from there of late, winning here three back and finishing fourth last start at Albion Park. No harm in drawing here with the sprint lane to rely upon. Finds a nice race and can return to winning form. The recent form of MULLUM DOC (1) may not appeal on paper but he has had a series of wide or second row barriers. He can do much better from the ace draw. B MAC C NZ (8) has been down the track at his last few but placed at Albion Park last month so is capable of better. WESTERN ARTERRA (9) could play a role with even luck.",
